    "settings": {},
    "subgraphDefs": {
      "ks_outline_kit": {
        "comments": [
          {
            "color": "#fbbf24",
            "id": "note_body",
            "position": {
              "x": 322,
              "y": 34
            },
            "size": {
              "h": 56,
              "w": 3908
            },
            "text": "**Outline + glow** — the Sprite Outline node samples the alpha on 8-direction rings (4 for the inner glow ring). The glow uses three rings (⅓, ⅔ and 1× the glow size) with weights 0.5 / 0.3 / 0.2, so coverage falls off in steps that read as a smooth halo.\nFinal = outline-sprite *over* glow: `α = a + g(1−a)`, `rgb = (rgb·a + glow·g(1−a)) / α`."
          }
        ],
